name: Inspect and rename finite context cases before installed native execution
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 Build project context: | context-prepared
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Common policy context
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | context-imported
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | fresh-study
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | common-picker
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | common-inspection
keys: b
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT CASES | baseline-case
keys: n C-u
type: Baseline policy
keys: Escape n
require-live-snap: 20 NAME CONTEXT CASE | retained-name
expect: Baseline policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | renamed-baseline
expect: Baseline policy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | selected-baseline-inspection
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | inspection-return
keys: a Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | candidate-base
keys: e Enter C-u
paste-file: @ART/candidate-context.txt
keys: C-s
require-live-snap: 20 REVIEW CONTEXT CHANGES | candidate-diff
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Edited copy saved | inactive-copy
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context for harmless | candidate-inspection
keys: +
require-live-snap: 20 2 cases | candidate-case
keys: n C-u
paste-file: @ART/invalid-name.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 cannot contain control | rejected-name
keys: C-End C-u
type: Owner context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | renamed-candidate
expect: Owner context
ask: Does the name field own typing and multiline paste, retain its unsaved draft on Back and refuse an invalid label without changing context, baseline or spending?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context for harmless | exact-candidate
keys: Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | duplicate-inspection
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 already included | duplicate-refused
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | candidate-kept
expect: Owner context
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT CASES | cases-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT CASES | cases-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT CASES | cases-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT CASES | cases-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 CONTEXT CASES | cases-40x12
keys: n
require-live-snap: 15 NAME CONTEXT CASE | name-40x12
expect: Owner context
keys: Escape
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | finite-workload
expect: 2 contexts · 6 fixed jobs
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | total-calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-review
type: 1
keys: Enter
keys: Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | matrix-ready
keys: L
require-live-snap: 35 Matrix draft ready | frozen-matrix
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | approval
expect: Baseline policy
expect: Owner context
expect: 60000 ms per job
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
expect: Protected review calls: 1
ask: Does approval identify both named exact contexts, the baseline, six jobs and protected review, with no implicit extra permutations or later follow-up?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | completed
keys: a Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter v
require-live-snap: 25 observed 3 / 3 | matrix-results
expect: Baseline policy
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 25 Owner context | candidate-results
ask: Are case labels, per-case denominators and uncertainty readable after six actual installed-scanner jobs, without claiming context caused different findings?
keys: b
require-live-snap: 20 Choose Baseline policy pass | baseline-pass
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Baseline pass selected | baseline-selected
keys: Enter Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 Pass 3 | candidate-pass
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 seen again | context-comparison
expect: Absence does not establish a fix.
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 FULL SOURCE & CONTEXT REFERENCES | comparison-conditions
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Pass 3 | comparison-return
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | comparison-case
keys: R
require-live-snap: 25 Context cases: 2 | matrix-report
expect: 0 committed / 1 calls
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 6 completed | restored-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 25 ┌ CONTEXT CASES | restored-cases
expect: Baseline policy
expect: Owner context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restored-inspection
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 CONTEXT CASES | restored-return
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/context_case_edit.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve names, baseline, exact revisions and spending while case inspection starts no further job or model call?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
